<title>CHILE: Chile's Enersis 9-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's Enersis 9-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electricity investment company Enersis SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>			     9-mo 1996	   9-mo 1995</p>
<p> Net profit		     86.91     profit  69.04</p>
<p> Operating loss		  2.09     loss     1.60</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	 88.68     profit  70.22</p>
<p> Total sales		     2.50		  2.50</p>
<p>NOTE: Enersis controls generator Endesa SA and distributor Chilectra SA. All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.  Enersis includes profits but not sales from Endesa and Chilectra as it is a holding company.</p>
<p>--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
